  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The initial concentrations of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HI</mi></math> as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>005</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn></math> mol/L, respectively, and the corresponding initial rates as given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>HI</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>molL</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>005</mn></mtd><mtd><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Rate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>molL</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p> For the reaction, rate law is<br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>rate</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>HI</mi></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msup></math><br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> is the order of the reaction.<br/>From the given data<br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>05</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msup></math>-------(1)<br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msup></math>  --------(2)<br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msup></math> ---------(3)<br/>On dividing Equation (3) by equation (2)<br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br/> </p>",
